  "description": "This fully renovated, spacious 1 bedroom apartment benefits from a premium location, within a  short walking distance to Grafton Street and the vibrant city centre.  Close to all  amenities, including cafés, restaurants, shopping, RCSI, Dublin Castle, Civic buildings, commercial offices and public transport. The Cannon Court Development was built to a high standard and this fourth floor apartment has been enhanced with a thorough upgrade, including  new heating, flooring, appliances, shower, furniture and fittings.  There is a large roof garden and terrace overlooking the beautiful St. Patrick's Cathedral Gardens.  The apartment is fully furnished with a spacious and bright living room, double bedroom, a fully fitted kitchen and plenty of wardrobe and storage space.\nCannon Court apartments are highly popular, due to their central and safe location and the quality of accommodation.\n\ne-mail enquiries only please and viewings will be arranged\nNo Pets, no parking, no smoking\nAvailable immediately\nRent excludes utility bills i.e.  electricity and internet\n\n-   Fourth floor Apartment with lift\n-   Newly renovated\n-   Electric Central Heating\n-   BER rating of B\n-   Large Double bedroom with built in wardrobes\n-   Separate kitchen\n-   Rooftop garden with stunning views\n-   Great location",
